onclusive. He also warns that the court will name her the forger.","location_id":"loc_envoy_house","character_ids":["chr_deva_anai","chr_suleiman_qadir"],"goal":"Qadir wants to keep the first slot until the monsoon is declared.","conflict":"His forged filing saved his season and may cost his name, and Deva must weigh an offer that would protect her but break her purpose.","outcome":"Deva refuses, and Qadir tells the court that she has forged the ledger herself, setting up a public hearing.","depends_on":["scn_the_pilots_steps"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Hour of the Turn","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_hearing_at_the_ghat","title":"The Hearing at the Ghat","summary":"At the Pilot Ghat the court gathers for the declaration. Deva names the false entry, Qadir swears over pepper that his filing was first, and Amara declares the turn on the honest hour, which falls after the time Qadir's entry claims.","location_id":"loc_pilot_ghat","character_ids":["chr_deva_anai","chr_suleiman_qadir","chr_amara"],"goal":"Deva wants to prove the true filing order before the court, and Qadir wants to keep his bought slot.","conflict":"Qadir's oath is binding under the oath-over-pepper rule, and Amara's rite asks the court to take her word on faith.","outcome":"Amara's honest hour proves the pre-dating, Qadir's oath is broken, and the court must follow the true order.","depends_on":["scn_qadirs_price"]},{"id":"scn_qadirs_choice","title":"The Name or the Slot","summary":"Facing ruin, Qadir has one last choice at the ghat: hold to his false claim and lose his name, or confess and surrender the slot. Deva, who has the proof, must decide whether to accuse the whole office or only the man.","location_id":"loc_pilot_ghat","character_ids":["chr_deva_anai","chr_suleiman_qadir"],"goal":"Qadir wants to save what he can of his fortune and name, and Deva wants the first slot to go only to whoever filed first.","conflict":"Qadir's belief that every record has a price pulls against a confession, and Deva's loyalty to the office that raised her pulls against naming its keepers.","outcome":"Qadir confesses the pre-dating and the gifts, and Deva enters the full account against the slot-keepers.","depends_on":["scn_hearing_at_the_ghat"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"The Ledger Re-Entered","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_the_slot_awarded","title":"The Slot Awarded","summary":"At the Harbour Office the court strikes the forged entry and awards the first sailing slot to the claim filed earliest, as the slot-order rule requires. The envoy who filed truly sails first, and Qadir's cargo waits for the second turn.","location_id":"loc_harbour_office","character_ids":["chr_deva_anai","chr_amara"],"goal":"Deva wants the true filing order entered in the ledger.","conflict":"The slot-keepers resist because their gifts are now exposed, and the court fears the cost of admitting a forged ledger.","outcome":"The ledger is corrected, the keepers are censured for the unregistered gifts, and the slot goes to the honest claimant.","depends_on":["scn_qadirs_choice"]},{"id":"scn_the_fleet_sails","title":"The Fleet Sails","summary":"At the Pepper Warehouses Qadir watches the first fleet load and leave without him, his season cost but his name left standing by his confession. Deva comes to tell him the audit is closed and the court will hear his debts.","location_id":"loc_pepper_warehouses","character_ids":["chr_deva_anai","chr_suleiman_qadir"],"goal":"Qadir wants to salvage his name and credit after losing the slot.","conflict":"His creditors will no longer wait smiling, and Deva must face what the audit cost the man who tempted her.","outcome":"Qadir accepts the loss and begins to rebuild on honest terms, and Deva sees that a record is only as honest as those who write it.","depends_on":["scn_the_slot_awarded"]},{"id":"scn_a_new_hand","title":"A New Hand in the Ledger","summary":"In the Harbour Office Deva sits at the corrected ledger as the court sets new rules for who may write in it. She now signs each entry herself and checks it against the sea's record, which Amara keeps at the ghat.","location_id":"loc_harbour_office","character_ids":["chr_deva_anai"],"goal":"Deva wants to see that the ledger stays honest from here on.","conflict":"Some of the court still resent a junior scribe who accused the office that raised her.","outcome":"Deva is given charge of the filing hours, and the ledger is kept by a hand the court has seen tested.","depends_on":["scn_the_fleet_sails"]}]}]}
